OL,5,G0020 Skin A&E
OL,6,     FIn this sporty episode, a boxing
OL,7,     Fcoach has a lipoma that looks like
OL,8,     Fan out-of-place ab, and a gym
OL,9,     Ffanatic has lumps on his arms that
OL,10,     Ffriends have mistaken for
OL,11,     Fodd-shaped muscles.
OL,12,G0125 Motorway Cops: Catching Britain's
OL,13,G     Speeders
OL,14,     FOn the night shift, PCs see a
OL,15,     Fdriver with his foot down in a
OL,16,     Ftop-of-the-range vehicle. And
OL,17,     Fafter spotting some cops, a man
OL,18,     Fditches his wheels to make off on
OL,19,     Ffoot.
